msgid "**Dedicated domain:** The admin UI is reachable on its own canonical hostname under the primary domain."
msgstr "**Domain Didedikasikan:** \\\"Admin UI\\\" dapat dijangkau dengan nama host kanonik sendiri di bawah domain utama."

msgid "**Dedicated runner:** Templates never run inside the server container: the server sets `SEMAPHORE_USE_REMOTE_RUNNER=true` and hands every task to the `task-runner` service, which signs in with the runner token the deploy seeds. Its image is an Infinito.Nexus image (`SOFTWARE_IMAGE`) plus the `semaphore` binary of the pinned server image, tagged with the tag of that Infinito.Nexus image. It mounts no Docker socket, runs as an unprivileged user, and reaches hosts only over SSH with the key held in the key store of the project."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Dedicated runner:** Templates never run inside the server container: the server sets ``SEMAPHORE_USE_REMOTE_RUNNER=true`` and hands every task to the ``task-runner`` service, which signs in with the runner token the deploy seeds. Its image is an Infinito.Nexus image (``SOFTWARE_IMAGE``) plus the ``semaphore`` binary of the pinned server image, tagged with the tag of that Infinito.Nexus image. It mounts no Docker socket, runs as an unprivileged user, and reaches hosts only over SSH with the key held in the key store of the project."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Dedicated, single-tenant, segmented node only.** The role MUST refuse to deploy on a node that carries any shared-workload label or hosts other tenants, and the node MUST be network-segmented from shared infrastructure. This is enforced, not just documented: a placement/preflight guard hard-fails on a shared node."
msgstr "**Didedikasi, tunggal-tenant, bersegmen nodal saja.** Peranan MUST AWAS menolak untuk menyebarkan pada sebuah node yang membawa setiap label share-workload atau host penyewa lain, dan node MUST yang disegmenkan jaringan dari infrastruktur bersama. Ini ditegakkan, bukan hanya didokumentasikan: sebuah penempatan/preflight guard hard-fails pada node bersama."

