# Setiap peran yang mendapatkan MCP permukaan MCP MUSST menambahkan
# spesifikasi Playwright yang cocok di bawah `roles/<role>/files/playwright/`
# Yang menggunakan permukaan MCP nya (Gagal disahkan pada server: %s). Tidak
# ada peran MCP yang dipertimbangkan dilaksanakan sampai tes Playwrightnya
# hadir dan hijau.
msgid "**Every MCP implementation ships a Playwright test.** Each role that gains an MCP surface MUST add a matching Playwright spec under `roles/<role>/files/playwright/` that exercises its MCP surface (a server role's authenticated endpoint, a client role's configured-server list). No MCP role is considered implemented until its Playwright test is present and green."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Every addon ships a Playwright test.** Each addon with a user-facing surface MUST add a matching Playwright spec under `roles/<role>/files/playwright/` that exercises that addon's behaviour (e.g. an `ldapauth`/`sociallogin` login path, a `wp-discourse` round-trip, an enabled Odoo module's UI entry point). Desktop roles (`desk-*`) drive no web surface a Playwright test could exercise and therefore NEVER ship addon specs — the lint forbids spec files under `desk-*` roles. For every web-facing role there is no per-addon exemption: an addon is considered migrated only once its Playwright spec is present and green. Cross-role integration specs (proving two roles are actually connected) run under a dedicated **integration-pair deploy variant** that co-deploys both partner roles, and are added incrementally as each ✅ pair is wired rather than all upfront."
msgstr "**Setiap addon kapal tes Playwright.** Adon setiap adon dengan MUSST permukaan facing pengguna tambahkan spesifikasi Playwright yang cocok di bawah `roles/<role>/files/playwright/` Yang melatih perilaku Adon (e.g. an `ldapauth`/ / / //`sociallogin` login jalur, a `wp-discourse` round-trip, sebuah titik masuk UI modul Odoo yang diaktifkan). Peranan desktop (`desk-*`) Tak ada pemacu permukaan web tes Playwright yang dapat digunakan dan karenanya TIDAK pernah menggunakan spesifikasi addon kapal — lint melarang berkas spesifikasi di bawah `desk-*` Peran. Untuk setiap peran web-facing tidak ada pengecualian per-addon: adon dianggap bermigrasi hanya sekali spesifikasi Playwright-nya hadir dan hijau. Spesifikasi integrasi lintas-role (membuktikan dua peran sebenarnya terhubung) Di bawah dedikasi **varian pengembangan integrasi-pasangan** Dan ditambah secara bertoko sebagai masing-masing ✅ Pair adalah kabel daripada semua depan."

msgid "**Every application-side integration is a 026 addon.** A consuming role declares a `translate` consumer entry gated on the gateway's service flag and an addon that bridges it. The applications in scope are the ones the architecture names: WordPress, Moodle, Discourse, OpenProject, Nextcloud and Matrix; which of them have an upstream consumer of this API is settled under [Re-opened Decisions](#re-opened-decisions)."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Every deploy rotates the AppRole.** The ``role_id``/``secret_id`` a run is handed are not the ones the running instance holds. ``tasks/01_init.yml`` tries the inventory pair, falls back to the pair recorded in ``.applied.json``, then ``tasks/06_rotate.yml`` re-pins to this run’s values and destroys the old SecretID. The record is written last, so a run that dies partway leaves the previous generation intact. ``custom-secret-id`` is **not** idempotent — re-writing a held SecretID answers ``500`` — so the swap is gated on the value having changed."
msgstr "**Setiap pengerahan memutar Approle.** Perancis ``role_id``/ / / //``secret_id`` Tak ada yang bisa berjalan. ``tasks/01_init.yml`` Pengcobaan venture pair, jatuh kembali ke pasangan direkam dalam ``.applied.json``, Kalau begitu ``tasks/06_rotate.yml`` Dia kembali ke nilai lari ini dan menghancurkan SecretID yang lama. Catatan itu ditulis terakhir, jadi larian yang mati sebagian meninggalkan generasi sebelumnya utuh. ``custom-secret-id`` Akan tetapi **Tidak** ifdempoten — menulis ulang jawaban SecretID yang diadakan ``500`` Maka, swap digerbangkan pada nilai yang telah berubah."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Every deploy rotates the AppRole.** The `role_id`/`secret_id` a run is handed are not the ones the running instance holds. `tasks/01_init.yml` tries the inventory pair, falls back to the pair recorded in `.applied.json`, then `tasks/06_rotate.yml` re-pins to this run's values and destroys the old SecretID. The record is written last, so a run that dies partway leaves the previous generation intact. `custom-secret-id` is **not** idempotent — re-writing a held SecretID answers `500` — so the swap is gated on the value having changed."
msgstr "**Setiap pengerahan memutar Approle.** Perancis `role_id`/ / / //`secret_id` Tak ada yang bisa berjalan. `tasks/01_init.yml` Pengcobaan venture pair, jatuh kembali ke pasangan direkam dalam `.applied.json`, Kalau begitu `tasks/06_rotate.yml` Dan menghancurkan SecretID lama. Catatan itu ditulis terakhir, jadi larian yang mati sebagian meninggalkan generasi sebelumnya utuh. `custom-secret-id` Akan tetapi **Tidak** ifdempoten — menulis ulang jawaban SecretID yang diadakan `500` Maka, swap digerbangkan pada nilai yang telah berubah."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Every mounted volume is discarded**, not only the backed-up ones. A volume declared `backup: false` claims to be disposable; a drill that spares it never tests the claim. If its service cannot rebuild it, the health gate goes red — that is the finding, not a false alarm. The single exception is the data directory of an engine whose dump is about to be replayed: it carries the database and its role, which the deploy creates and the container does not, so wiping it would leave `baudolo-restore --empty -d <db>` with nothing to connect to and the drill would fail at itself instead of at a defect."
msgstr "**Setiap volume yang dilekap dibuang**Bukan hanya yang didukung. Sebuah volume dinyatakan `backup: false` Klaimnya sekali pakai; bor yang tidak pernah menguji klaim. Jika dinasnya tidak dapat membangunnya kembali, gerbang kesehatan menjadi merah — itulah temuannya, bukan alarm palsu. Pengecualian tunggal adalah direktori data dari mesin yang dumpnya akan diputar ulang: ia membawa basis data dan perannya, yang disebar menciptakan dan kontainer tidak, jadi menghapusnya akan pergi `baudolo-restore --empty -d <db>` Tak ada hubungannya dan latihan akan gagal pada dirinya sendiri daripada pada cacat."

# translated-by: libretranslate
