msgid "**New and reshaped roles.** *sys-svc-nss* is split out of *sys-hostname*, *web-svc-mirror* serves frontend assets as a privacy proxy, PeerTube becomes clearnet-only, and roles that could not run were deleted rather than repaired. CLI tools install via pip instead of pkgmgr."
msgstr "**Peran baru dan berbentuk ulang.** *sys-svc-nss* Dipecah dari *sys-hostname*, *web-svc-mirror* Kami melayani aset frontend sebagai proksi privasi, PeerTube Kekhalifahan menjadi clearnet-only, dan peran yang tidak dapat dijalankan dihapus daripada diperbaiki. Alat-alat CLI dipasang melalui pip daripada pkgmgr."

# diselesaikan melalui pencarian, layanan penjadwal harus menyatakan *Replika:
# 1*, dan volume pemilik peran tumpukan harus menyatakan kebijakan cadangan
# mereka. *role_path* Hal ini dilarang dalam shell dan mayat komando. Baku
# deployment-mode, container-inspeksi resolver, asinkron-task rasionales dan
# deklarasi pemeriksaan kesehatan divalidasi secara terpusat. Takrifan dan
# dokumentasi Hadolint *[*] nocheck* pengecualian diakui alih-alih
# menghasilkan positif palsu.
msgid "**New lint contracts.** Port variables must resolve through lookups, scheduler services must declare *replicas: 1*, and volume-owning stack roles must declare their backup policy. *role_path* is forbidden in shell and command bodies. Deployment-mode defaults, container-inspection resolvers, asynchronous-task rationales and health-check declarations are validated centrally. Hadolint directives and documented *nocheck* exceptions are recognized instead of producing false positives."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
