# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Required addons are explicit, and install failure is gated by `required`.** Every addon carries a boolean `required` field (default `false`). Core components that are part of the deployed app contract, such as Odoo's core modules, use `required: true`: they are always installed, MAY omit `enabled`, and MUST NOT set `enabled: false`. The field also governs install-failure behaviour: when an addon's installation fails, a `required: true` addon MUST hard-fail the play (the deploy stops), while a `required: false` addon MUST only emit a warning, skip that addon, and let the play continue."
msgstr "**Addon yang diperlukan adalah eksplisit, dan kegagalan pemasangan digeret oleh `required`.** Setiap addon membawa boolean `required` lapangan (default `false`). Komponen inti yang merupakan bagian dari kontrak aplikasi yang dikerahkan, seperti modul inti Odoo, gunakan `required: true`: Mereka selalu dipasang, MAY omit `enabled`, dan JANGAN DIJADI `enabled: false`. lapangan juga mengatur perilaku install-failure: ketika pemasangan addon gagal, a `required: true` \\\"Adon addon MUST keras-gagal bermain (Membebaskan pasukan berhenti), sementara `required: false` Addon MUST hanya memancarkan peringatan, lewati addon itu, dan biarkan drama berlanjut."

