msgid "**Role Groups:** On every new session [files/sso/header_auth.py](./files/sso/header_auth.py) sets the BookWyrm groups `admin`, `owner`, `moderator` and `editor` from the `administrator`, `owner`, `moderator` and `editor` role groups and grants staff with `admin`. The platform administrator that [tasks/01_site.yml](./tasks/01_site.yml) converges keeps its groups."
