# terhadap Keycloak (`sso.flavor: saml` dalam
# [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml))Jangan di depan itu. Permintaan
# yang tak dikonfirmasi dikonfirmasi mengenai titik masuk SASL firewall
# Symfony, yang dialihkan ke KeycloakAfirmasi kembali ke `/saml/acs` dan
# membenarkan yang nyata SuiteCRM sesi jogory, sehingga aplikasi memberikan UI
# terotentikasi sendiri termasuk kontrol log keluarnya. Akun-akun fine
# diciptakan pada login pertama dari pernyataan (`SAML_AUTO_CREATE`), dan IDP
# tandatangan sertifikat dibaca dari Keycloak\"Peneror alam\" oleh
# [`files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh`](./files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh) Di
# boot, melalui proksi Tor SOCKS setiap kali penerbit adalah bawang, karena
# `.onion` Permasalahan tidak dapat diselesaikan secara langsung. `/auth`
# Jangan sampai bisa dihubungi sebagai break-glass login lokal.
# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**SSO** is SuiteCRM's own SAML login against Keycloak (`sso.flavor: saml` in [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml)), not a proxy in front of it. Unauthenticated requests hit the Symfony firewall's SAML entry point, which redirects to Keycloak; the assertion comes back to `/saml/acs` and establishes a real SuiteCRM session, so the app renders its own authenticated UI including its logout control. Accounts are created on first login from the assertion (`SAML_AUTO_CREATE`), and the IdP signing certificate is read from Keycloak's realm descriptor by [`files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh`](./files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh) at boot, over the Tor SOCKS proxy whenever the issuer is an onion, because a `.onion` issuer is unresolvable directly. `/auth` stays reachable as the local break-glass login."
msgstr "**SSO** Akan tetapi SuiteCRM\\\"Moin Login SASL sendiri terhadap Keycloak (`sso.flavor: saml` dalam [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml))Jangan di depan itu. Permintaan yang tak dikonfirmasi dikonfirmasi mengenai titik masuk SASL firewall Symfony, yang dialihkan ke KeycloakAfirmasi kembali ke `/saml/acs` dan membenarkan yang nyata SuiteCRM sesi jogory, sehingga aplikasi memberikan UI terotentikasi sendiri termasuk kontrol log keluarnya. Akun-akun fine diciptakan pada login pertama dari pernyataan (`SAML_AUTO_CREATE`), dan IDP tandatangan sertifikat dibaca dari Keycloak\\\"Peneror alam\\\" oleh [`files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh`](./files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh) Di boot, melalui proksi Tor SOCKS setiap kali penerbit adalah bawang, karena `.onion` Permasalahan tidak dapat diselesaikan secara langsung. `/auth` Jangan sampai bisa dihubungi sebagai break-glass login lokal."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**SSO** is SuiteCRM’s own SAML login against Keycloak (``sso.flavor: saml`` in ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__), not a proxy in front of it. Unauthenticated requests hit the Symfony firewall’s SAML entry point, which redirects to Keycloak; the assertion comes back to ``/saml/acs`` and establishes a real SuiteCRM session, so the app renders its own authenticated UI including its logout control. Accounts are created on first login from the assertion (``SAML_AUTO_CREATE``), and the IdP signing certificate is read from Keycloak’s realm descriptor by ```files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh`` <./files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh>`__ at boot, over the Tor SOCKS proxy whenever the issuer is an onion, because a ``.onion`` issuer is unresolvable directly. ``/auth`` stays reachable as the local break-glass login."
msgstr "**SSO** Akan tetapi SuiteCRMPengguna SAML sendiri menentang Keycloak (``sso.flavor: saml`` dalam ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__), not a proxy in front of it. Unauthenticated requests hit the Symfony firewall’s SAML entry point, which redirects to Keycloak; the assertion comes back to ``/saml/acs`` and establishes a real SuiteCRM session, so the app renders its own authenticated UI including its logout control. Accounts are created on first login from the assertion (``SAML_AUTO_CREATE``), and the IdP signing certificate is read from Keycloak’s realm descriptor by ```files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh`` <./files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh>`__ at boot, over the Tor SOCKS proxy whenever the issuer is an onion, because a ``.onion`` issuer is unresolvable directly. ``/auth`` Jangan sampai bisa dihubungi sebagai break-glass login lokal."

