# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Any `gh gpg-key` subcommand. `add` installs a persistent commit-signing identity an attacker could use to impersonate the operator on signed commits; `delete` can lock the operator out of signed-commit policies; `list` leaks the key-fingerprint inventory. Out-of-band key management only."
msgstr "Mana Saja `gh gpg-key` Subcommand. `add` Menginstal identitas tanda-tangan yang persisten commit-signing penyerang dapat digunakan untuk menyamar operator pada signed commits; `delete` Coady dapat mengunci operator keluar dari kebijakan signed-commit; `list` Kebocoran joint print kunci. Hanya manajemen kunci diluar jalur."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Any `gh secret` subcommand. `set`/`remove` mutate CI secrets under the operator's identity; `list` leaks secret names, the exact same risk class as the `gh api * /actions/secrets*` deny (\"Even GETs leak secret names\"). Out-of-band secret management only."
msgstr "Mana Saja `gh secret` Subcommand. `set`/ / / //`remove` Mustate rahasia CI di bawah identitas operator; `list` Kebocoran nama rahasia, kelas risiko yang sama persis dengan `gh api * /actions/secrets*` Nafi (\"Bahkan GETETS bocor nama rahasia\"). Hanya manajemen rahasia di luar jaringan."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Any `gh ssh-key` subcommand. `add` is a persistent auth backdoor giving shell-equivalent push access until revoked; `delete` can lock the operator out; `list` leaks the key-fingerprint inventory. Out-of-band key management only."
msgstr "Mana Saja `gh ssh-key` Subcommand. `add` Dia adalah orang yang terus-menerus memberi akses untuk mendorong sampai dibatalkan; `delete` LUAR dapat mengunci operator keluar; `list` Kebocoran joint print kunci. Hanya manajemen kunci diluar jalur."

