msgid "Fork-PR CI hardening (follow-up to the 11.1.0 trusted-fork flow): the privileged *pull_request_target* image producer and mirror now set *allow-unsafe-pr-checkout* so *actions/checkout* stops refusing the merged fork ref it had begun rejecting. Untrusted fork builds run without organization secrets — they authenticate to GHCR with the per-job *GITHUB_TOKEN* only and mirror Docker Hub anonymously — while the maintainer-trusted path keeps full credentials and builds the raw PR head. The trust switch moved to the *🛡️ Trusted* label. See [the fork-PR pipeline](docs/contributing/artefact/git/pipeline.md) and [the GHCR authentication reference](docs/contributing/tools/ghcr/authentication.md)."
msgstr "Penkerasan CI Fork-PR (Menindaklanjuti 11.1.0 Aliran-fork terpercaya): Yang istimewa *pull_request_target* produsen gambar dan cermin sekarang ditetapkan *Tidak aman-pr-checkout* Jadi *tindakan/checkout* Cairan berhenti menolak ref fork yang digabung itu mulai menolak. Garpu yang tidak dipercaya membangun dijalankan tanpa rahasia organisasi — mereka mengotentifikasi ke GHCR dengan per-job *GITHUB_TOKEN* Hanya cermin dan cermin Docker Hub tanpa nama — sementara jalan yang dipercaya sebagai pengelola tetap penuh bukti dan membangun kepala PR mentah. switch kepercayaan pindah ke *🛡️ Dipercaya* label. Lihat [Membeli pipa garpu-PR](docs/contributing/artefact/git/pipeline.md) Dan [Referensi otentifikasi GHCR](docs/contributing/tools/ghcr/authentication.md)."

