# susunan susunan sebagai web-app-erpnext Peran org — backend, frontend,
# websocket, penjadwal dan dua pekerja antrian — terhubung ke pusat Keycloak
# Melalui dibangun Keycloak Kunci Log Masuk Sosial dan ke pusat OpenLDAP Kata
# kerja melalui doctype Pengaturan LDAP. Matriks tiga-varian (Hanya LDAP) Nama
# tugas Ansible end-to-end dan repo-wide lint caps Ansible di 120 \"Nova
# characters\".
# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "New ERPNext role that ships the upstream Frappe Framework v15 stack as a web-app-erpnext role — backend, frontend, websocket, scheduler and two queue workers — wired into the central Keycloak via a built-in Keycloak Social Login Key and into the central OpenLDAP via the LDAP Settings doctype. The three-variant matrix (SSO plus LDAP, no auth, LDAP only) is exercised end-to-end and a repo-wide lint caps Ansible task names at 120 characters."
msgstr "New ERPNext Peran yang kapal hulu Bruppe Framework v15 susunan susunan sebagai web-app-erpnext Peran org — backend, frontend, websocket, penjadwal dan dua pekerja antrian — terhubung ke pusat Keycloak Melalui dibangun Keycloak Kunci Log Masuk Sosial dan ke pusat OpenLDAP Kata kerja melalui doctype Pengaturan LDAP. Matriks tiga-varian (Hanya LDAP) Nama tugas Ansible end-to-end dan repo-wide lint caps Ansible di 120 \\\"Nova characters\\\"."

