msgid "The `API.cloudflare.api_token` value (declared in `group_vars/all/18_api.yml`, read via `lookup('api', 'cloudflare.api_token')`) must contain a valid Cloudflare API Token.   This token is used for all DNS operations and ACME (SSL/TLS certificate) challenges that require access to your Cloudflare-managed domains."
msgstr "Perancis `API.cloudflare.api_token` Nilai (\\\"Namun dinyatakan dalam\\\" `group_vars/all/18_api.yml`, baca via `lookup('api', 'cloudflare.api_token')`) Harus mengandung Cloudflare yang valid API Token. token ini digunakan untuk semua operasi DNS dan ACME (Sertifikat SSL/TLS) Tantangan yang membutuhkan akses ke domain Cloudflare-managed Anda."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `Bash(*)` allow grants broad access to the `docker` CLI (alongside every other shell command) under the assumption that no production containers share the host. Non-mutating-image subcommands (`rm`, `kill`, `stop`, `system prune`, `volume rm`, `cp`) can disrupt or destroy container state. Under test-only usage, the blast radius is bounded to ephemeral state that can be recreated from the compose stack."
msgstr "Perancis `Bash(*)` Memungkinkan hibah akses luas ke `docker` CLI (Di samping setiap perintah shell lainnya) Di bawah asumsi bahwa tidak ada wadah produksi berbagi tuan rumah. Subperintah gambar non-mutasi (`rm`, `kill`, `stop`, `system prune`, `volume rm`, `cp`) Kebengkelan dapat mengganggu atau menghancurkan negara kontainer. Di bawah penggunaan tes-hanya, radius ledakan terikat pada keadaan ephemeral yang dapat diciptakan kembali dari tumpukan compose."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `Bash(*)` allow lets the agent run any Makefile target without prompting. The `Makefile` is checked into git and reviewed on every pull request, so targets themselves are trusted. Every action a target performs still runs inside the sandbox."
msgstr "Perancis `Bash(*)` Biarkan agen menjalankan target Makefile tanpa meminta. Perancis `Makefile` git diperiksa dan ditinjau dari setiap permintaan tarikan, sehingga target sendiri dipercaya. Setiap aksi yang dilakukan target masih berjalan di dalam kotak pasir."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The `Corefile.tmpl` MUST be the source of truth. It is rendered to `Corefile` by [coredns.py](../../cli/administration/deploy/development/coredns.py), which substitutes its `${VAR}` placeholders in-process, using values from `.env` (generated from [default.env](../../default.env), overridable through the CLI's environment)."
msgstr "Perancis `Corefile.tmpl` Harus menjadi sumber kebenaran. Hal ini diberikan kepada `Corefile` Oleh: [coredns.py](../../cli/administration/deploy/development/coredns.py), Yang menggantikan `${VAR}` placeholder in-process, menggunakan nilai dari `.env` (dijana dari [default.env](../../default.env), Terlampaui lingkungan CLI.)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `GitHub Actions self-hosted runner <https://docs.github.com/en/actions/hosting-your-own-runners/managing-self-hosted-runners/about-self-hosted-runners>`__ is an agent that runs GitHub Actions workflow jobs on your own infrastructure instead of GitHub-hosted machines."
msgstr "Perancis `GitHub Actions self-hosted runner <https://docs.github.com/en/actions/hosting-your-own-runners/managing-self-hosted-runners/about-self-hosted-runners>`__ Dia agen yang menjalankan pekerjaan workflow GitHub Actions di infrastrukturmu sendiri dan bukan mesin GitHub-hosted."

