# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `biber` and `administrator` Playwright personas are gated on `services.sso.enabled`. When SSO is off, [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renders `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. Two reasons:"
msgstr "Perancis `biber` Dan `administrator` Playwright personas yang digerekan `services.sso.enabled`. Ketika SSO mati, [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) ERD `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` Dan `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. Dua alasan:"

