# [`files/mcp/tools.json`](./files/mcp/tools.json) Nama-nama sembilan alat
# baca `calendar`, `contacts` Dan `files` - tiga kategori yang hulunya
# `is_available` Dia tidak bersyarat, jadi setnya tidak bervariasi dengan
# aplikasi opsional mana yang memasang penyebaran. `svc-ai-mcp-adapter` Tak
# ada yang menolak alat apapun di luar daftar itu dan alat apapun yang
# ditandai `mutating` ♪ Sementara ♪ `mutating_tools_enabled` Itu palsu, dan
# itu menolak untuk memulai sama sekali jika kontrak `schema_sha256` Tidak
# sesuai dengan file. Penolakan tersebut terjadi di sidecar, sehingga berlaku
# untuk setiap klien terlepas dari apa yang masing-masing diberikan secara
# lokal.
msgid "The adapter is what bounds that. [`files/mcp/tools.json`](./files/mcp/tools.json) names the nine read tools of `calendar`, `contacts` and `files` — the three categories whose upstream `is_available` is unconditional, so the set does not vary with which optional apps a deployment installs. `svc-ai-mcp-adapter` refuses any tool outside that list and any tool marked `mutating` while `mutating_tools_enabled` is false, and it refuses to start at all if the contract's `schema_sha256` does not match the file. The refusal happens in the sidecar, so it holds for every client regardless of what each renders locally."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The adapter is what bounds that. ```files/mcp/tools.json`` <./files/mcp/tools.json>`__ names the nine read tools of ``calendar``, ``contacts`` and ``files`` — the three categories whose upstream ``is_available`` is unconditional, so the set does not vary with which optional apps a deployment installs. ``svc-ai-mcp-adapter`` refuses any tool outside that list and any tool marked ``mutating`` while ``mutating_tools_enabled`` is false, and it refuses to start at all if the contract’s ``schema_sha256`` does not match the file. The refusal happens in the sidecar, so it holds for every client regardless of what each renders locally."
msgstr "Adapter adalah apa batas itu. ```files/mcp/tools.json`` <./files/mcp/tools.json>`__ names the nine read tools of ``calendar``, ``contacts`` and ``files`` — the three categories whose upstream ``is_available`` is unconditional, so the set does not vary with which optional apps a deployment installs. ``svc-ai-mcp-adapter`` refuses any tool outside that list and any tool marked ``mutating`` while ``mutating_tools_enabled`` is false, and it refuses to start at all if the contract’s ``schema_sha256`` Tidak sesuai dengan file. Penolakan tersebut terjadi di sidecar, sehingga berlaku untuk setiap klien terlepas dari apa yang masing-masing diberikan secara lokal."

