msgid "The map of which role wires in which is derived from the roles themselves on every docs build, by [infinito_docs/generators/integrations.py](../../roles/web-app-docs/files/python/infinito_docs/generators/integrations.py), and reached from [docs/architecture/integrations.rst](../architecture/integrations.rst). Its two sources are the declarations this requirement governs: a **wired** edge comes from a top-level service key in the row role's `meta/services.yml`, and a **declared** edge from the `bridges:` entry of a `meta/addons/*.yml`. Edges are directional — the row hosts the flag or the plugin — so a bidirectional pair such as `nextcloud`↔`openproject` appears twice. It currently covers 98 roles with **811 wired edges plus 99 bridged addon edges**."
