msgid "The persona test \"administrator: app → universal logout\" in `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` does not enter the admin while `two_factor.enabled` is true: the shared native sign-in stops at Magento's two-factor page and the flow logs out through the link of that page. With the flag off it enters the admin and signs out through the account menu. `files/playwright/test-admin-sign-in.js` asserts the sign-in in both states of the flag."
