msgstr "Direktori ini berisi skrip spesifik platform untuk mempercayai sertifikat Infinito Root CA pada mesin pengembang. Untuk kanonikal Membuat target indeks yang memanggil pembantu ini, lihat [make.md](../../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains project requirements documents. Its scope is user stories and acceptance criteria that define what the project must do and that guide agent-assisted implementation."
msgstr "Direktori ini berisi dokumen persyaratan proyek. Skopnya adalah cerita pengguna dan kriteria penerimaan yang mendefinisikan apa yang harus proyek lakukan dan yang memandu implementasi agen-assisted."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains project-specific Ansible modules used by Infinito.Nexus."
msgstr "Direktori ini berisi modul Ansible spesifik-proyek yang digunakan oleh Infinito.Nexus."

msgid "This directory contains pure resolvers that read repository state (git history, role metadata, version tags, input environment variables) and emit resolved values either via `$GITHUB_OUTPUT` or stdout. Resolvers MUST be idempotent and MUST NOT mutate repository or registry state beyond writing to `$GITHUB_OUTPUT`. The covered concerns are diff-driven app whitelist resolution, the `🧩 Subset` label dispatch (`pr_affected_roles.sh`, which picks between the PR-body subset and the diff resolver), release-tag detection, app discovery for the deploy matrix, the count of leading batches that hold priority rows (`priority_batches.sh`, which stars those batches' job names), and change detection that gates the update pipeline."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains repository-specific resolvers used across workflows and shell helpers."
msgstr "Direktori ini berisi resolver khusus repositori yang digunakan di seluruh alur kerja dan pembantu shell."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains resolver scripts for detecting missing derived artifacts and release metadata."
msgstr "Direktori ini berisi skrip resolver untuk mendeteksi artefak turunan yang hilang dan data meta rilis."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains scripts for managing TLS/PKI concerns in the Infinito Nexus development environment. For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
msgstr "Direktori ini berisi skrip untuk mengelola kekhawatiran TLS/PKI dalam lingkungan pengembangan Infinito Nexus. Untuk kanonikal Membuat target indeks yang memanggil pembantu ini, lihat [make.md](../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This directory contains scripts for managing systemd across different platforms and environments used in Infinito Nexus development. For the canonical Make target index that invokes these helpers, see [make.md](../../../docs/contributing/tools/make.md)."
