# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys **Shopware 6** using **Docker**. It automates installation, migration, and configuration of your storefront, integrating with a central **MariaDB** database. Optional components like **Redis** and **OpenSearch** enhance performance and search capabilities, while **OIDC** integrates the administration backend with **Keycloak**. Directory accounts sign in the same way: Shopware has no admin-LDAP extension this role can install, so LDAP identities arrive through Keycloak's user federation rather than through a plugin of their own."
msgstr "Peran ini dikerahkan **Shopware 6** Nama **Perancis**Ini otomat instalasi, migrasi, dan konfigurasi toko Anda, terintegrasi dengan pusat **MariaDB** Basis data. Komponen opsional seperti **Redis** Dan **OpenSearch** meningkatkan kinerja dan kemampuan pencarian, sementara **OIDC** Dia mengintegrasikan bagian belakang administrasi dengan **Keycloak**Catatan direktori menandatangani dengan cara yang sama: Shopware tidak memiliki ekstensi admin-LDAP peran ini dapat dipasang, sehingga identitas LDAP tiba melalui Keycloakfederasi pengguna dari pada melalui plugin sendiri."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys **Shopware 6** using **Docker**. It automates installation, migration, and configuration of your storefront, integrating with a central **MariaDB** database. Optional components like **Redis** and **OpenSearch** enhance performance and search capabilities, while **OIDC** integrates the administration backend with **Keycloak**. Directory accounts sign in the same way: Shopware has no admin-LDAP extension this role can install, so LDAP identities arrive through Keycloak’s user federation rather than through a plugin of their own."
