# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys a self-hosted Bluesky stack on Docker Compose. It runs the official PDS container as the user-data layer, builds the upstream `@bluesky-social/social-app` web client as the user-facing UI, and adds an in-role login-broker sidecar that gates the web client through Keycloak via `web-app-keycloak`'s SSO-proxy sidecar. The broker auto-provisions PDS accounts for incoming OIDC users, holds the synthesised app-password AES-256-GCM-encrypted in a process-local cache, and drops a usable PDS session into the social-app's local storage so end users never see the synthesised credential."
msgstr "Peran ini mengerahkan diri sebagai tuan rumah Bluesky susunan pada Docker ComposeIni menjalankan resmi PDS kontainer sebagai lapisan data pengguna, membangun hulu `@bluesky-social/social-app` Klien web sebagai pengguna-facing UI, dan menambahkan sebuah in-role login-broker sidecar yang gerbang klien web melalui Keycloak via ator `web-app-keycloak`Mobil samping SSO-proksi. OIDC, pemegang hak paten app-password AES-256-GCM-dienkripsi dalam cache lokal proses, dan menjatuhkan sesi PDS yang dapat digunakan ke penyimpanan lokal social-app sehingga pengguna akhir tidak pernah melihat kredensial sintesis."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys a self-hosted Bluesky stack on Docker Compose. It runs the official PDS container as the user-data layer, builds the upstream ``@bluesky-social/social-app`` web client as the user-facing UI, and adds an in-role login-broker sidecar that gates the web client through Keycloak via ``web-app-keycloak``\\ ’s SSO-proxy sidecar. The broker auto-provisions PDS accounts for incoming OIDC users, holds the synthesised app-password AES-256-GCM-encrypted in a process-local cache, and drops a usable PDS session into the social-app’s local storage so end users never see the synthesised credential."
