# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys an OpenResty container via Docker Compose, validates its configuration, and restarts it on changes."
msgstr "Peran ini mengerahkan peran ini OpenResty kontainer via Docker Compose, memvalidasi konfigurasinya, dan memulai ulang pada perubahan."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys and configures the Roulette Wheel application using Docker Compose. It pulls the latest source code from a Git repository, builds a Docker image from a configurable Node.js base, and starts the application on a user-defined local HTTP port."
msgstr "Peran ini mengerahkan dan mengatur Roulette Wheel Aplikasi menggunakan Docker ComposeIni menarik kode sumber terbaru dari Git Repositori, bina gambar Docker dari yang dapat dikonfigurasi Node.js Basis, dan mulai aplikasi pada port HTTP lokal definisi pengguna."

msgid "This role deploys ejabberd on Docker Compose with the project's standard role-meta wiring. It binds ejabberd's `auth_method` to `svc-db-openldap` so XMPP clients authenticate against the project's central LDAP. ejabberd has no OIDC client, so the role declares no `sso` service and LDAP is its only sign-in path."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role deploys ejabberd on Docker Compose with the project’s standard role-meta wiring. It binds ejabberd’s ``auth_method`` to ``svc-db-openldap`` so XMPP clients authenticate against the project’s central LDAP. ejabberd has no OIDC client, so the role declares no ``sso`` service and LDAP is its only sign-in path."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys n8n Community Edition using the upstream ``docker.n8n.io/n8nio/n8n`` image backed by a PostgreSQL database (consumed from the central ``svc-db-postgres`` via ``sys-stk-full``). Authentication is handled by an **oauth2-proxy** sidecar (Keycloak OIDC) in V1, or left to n8n’s own user-management UI in V2. n8n Community Edition does not support LDAP — it is gated behind n8n’s Enterprise license (``ldap.controller.ee.js`` is not registered in CE) — so no LDAP variant is offered. Credentials stored inside n8n are encrypted at rest with a stable ``N8N_ENCRYPTION_KEY``."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys n8n Community Edition using the upstream `docker.n8n.io/n8nio/n8n` image backed by a PostgreSQL database (consumed from the central `svc-db-postgres` via `sys-stk-full`). Authentication is handled by an **oauth2-proxy** sidecar (Keycloak OIDC) in V1, or left to n8n's own user-management UI in V2. n8n Community Edition does not support LDAP — it is gated behind n8n's Enterprise license (`ldap.controller.ee.js` is not registered in CE) — so no LDAP variant is offered. Credentials stored inside n8n are encrypted at rest with a stable `N8N_ENCRYPTION_KEY`."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys no AI surface and declares no ``litellm`` service, because EspoCRM’s open-source distribution does not ship one. At the pinned version ``10.0.4``, ``application/Espo/Modules`` contains only ``Crm``, ``application/Espo/Resources/metadata/app/config.json`` declares no AI key, and the release ZIP the image is built from leaves ``custom/Espo/Modules`` empty. The AI features (Summary, Intelligent Paste, AI Email Composer, AI formula functions) live exclusively in the commercial `Intelligence extension <https://www.espocrm.com/extensions/intelligence/>`__, which is closed source, requires a purchased license, and is published in no ``espocrm`` GitHub repository. Bumping the version does not change this: the extension is documented as requiring EspoCRM 10.0.3 or greater, so newer cores stay hosts for it rather than absorbing it."
msgstr "Peran ini mengerahkan tidak ada permukaan AI dan menyatakan tidak ``litellm`` Layanan, karena EspoCRMDistribusi open-source milik Voinza tidak dapat dikapalkan. Di versi terjepit ``10.0.4``, ``application/Espo/Modules`` hanya mengandung ``Crm``, ``application/Espo/Resources/metadata/app/config.json`` Tidak ada kunci AI, dan rilis ZIP gambar dibangun dari daun ``custom/Espo/Modules`` Kosong. Fitur AI (Ringkasan, Intelligent Tempel, Penggubah AI Email, fungsi rumus AI) Hidup secara eksklusif dalam komersial `Intelligence extension <https://www.espocrm.com/extensions/intelligence/>`__, yang merupakan sumber tertutup, membutuhkan lisensi yang dibeli, dan diterbitkan tidak ``espocrm`` Tambahkan ke repositori Versi tersebut tidak mengubah ini: ekstensi didokumentasikan sebagai kebutuhan EspoCRM 10.0.3 Atau lebih besar, jadi inti yang lebih baru tinggal host untuk itu daripada menyerapnya."

