# dan memancarkan satu blok kubah per daun skalar ke ``dest_node``. Tersarang
# dicts ((c.g. ``secrets.credentials.recaptcha = {key, secret}``) Sia-sia
# recurse in in nested CommentedMaps Jadi setiap daun menjadi sendiri lemari
# besi-terenkripsi masuk daripada di runtuhkan melalui ``str(dict)`` Ke dalam
# gumpalan python-repr (regresi yang pecah lari 26428080957 Pekerjaan
# 77797371397 Dan 77797371442 ♪ untuk ♪ web-app-espocrm Dan web-app-listmonk).
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Walk a (possibly nested) credentials schema and emit one vault block per scalar leaf into ``dest_node``. Nested dicts (e.g. ``secrets.credentials.recaptcha = {key, secret}``) recurse into nested CommentedMaps so each leaf becomes its own vault-encrypted entry instead of being collapsed via ``str(dict)`` into a Python-repr blob (the regression that broke run 26428080957 jobs 77797371397 and 77797371442 for web-app-espocrm and web-app-listmonk)."
msgstr ""

