# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST check that every environment variable referenced in `playwright.spec.js` is present in the rendered `.env` (the name-alignment MUST is owned by the contrib SPOT Environment Contract)."
msgstr "Anda harus memeriksa bahwa setiap variabel lingkungan dirujuk dalam `playwright.spec.js` Ada di taman `.env` (\\\"MUSST Perataan Nama\\\" dimiliki oleh Kontrak Lingkungan SPOT Contritrib)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST check that persona-specific credentials such as `biber` and `administrator` map to the intended scenarios."
msgstr "Anda harus memeriksa bahwa persona-bukti kelayakan seperti `biber` Dan `administrator` Peta untuk skenario yang dimaksudkan."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You MUST check that the final JavaScript still feels like a small role-local adaptation of the target application, not a forked frontend implementation."
msgstr "Anda MUSST periksa bahwa JavaScript akhir masih terasa seperti adaptasi peran-lokal kecil dari aplikasi target, bukan implementasi frontend bercabang."

