msgid "[Coturn](https://github.com/coturn/coturn) is a free and open-source **TURN (Traversal Using Relays around NAT)** and **STUN (Session Traversal Utilities for NAT)** server.   It enables real-time communication (RTC) applications such as **WebRTC** to work reliably across NATs and firewalls."
msgstr "[Coturn](https://github.com/coturn/coturn) Kau bebas dan sumber terbuka. **TURN (Traversal Menggunakan Relays di sekitar NAT)** Dan **STUN (Utilitas Traversal Sesi untuk NAT)** Server. Hal ini memungkinkan komunikasi real-time (Perancis) Aplikasi aplikasi seperti **WebRTC** Kami bekerja di seluruh NAT dan firewall."

