# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[Hugo](https://gohugo.io/) is a fast, single-binary static site generator written in Go. This role builds a Hugo site from any upstream Git repository (default: [gohugoio/hugoDocs](https://github.com/gohugoio/hugoDocs)) at image-build time and serves the rendered HTML/CSS/JS via nginx. There is no database, no application server, and no dynamic backend at runtime."
msgstr "[Perancis](https://gohugo.io/) Dia cepat, satu-binary static site generator tertulis di Go. Peran ini membangun Hugo Situs dari hulu sungai Git Tambahkan ke Projek (Baku [gohugoio/hugoDocs](https://github.com/gohugoio/hugoDocs)) Pada waktu membangun gambar dan melayani dirender HTML/CSS/JS via nginx. Tak ada basis data, tak ada server aplikasi, dan tak ada backend dinamis saat runtime."

