msgid "[x] **Clarifying questions only at the start.** Any open question, ambiguity, or missing decision (e.g. which CI runner technology, what the `distribution` parameter switches, how `roles` is interpreted, what the `output stream file` default is, lifecycle starting tier, secrets/registration-token source) MUST be raised once at the very beginning of the run, in a single batched question round, BEFORE any file is changed. Once those questions are answered, the agent MUST NOT pause for further clarification — additional ambiguities discovered mid-run MUST be resolved by the agent using its best judgement, recorded in the role's `README.md` or a code comment, and revisited only at PR review."
msgstr "[x x] **Menyalahkan pertanyaan hanya di awal.** Setiap pertanyaan terbuka, ambiguitas, atau keputusan hilang (E.g. teknologi CI pelari, apa `distribution` parameter switches, bagaimana `roles` Itu ditafsirkan, apa yang `output stream file` Baku adalah, lifecycle mulai tier, rahasia/registrasi-token sumber) MUST dinaikkan sekali di awal lari, dalam satu babak pertanyaan, SEBELUM berkas berubah. Setelah pertanyaan-pertanyaan itu dijawab, agen JANGAN berhenti untuk klarifikasi lebih lanjut — masalah tambahan yang ditemukan pertengahan lari MUST diselesaikan oleh agen menggunakan penilaian terbaik, dicatat dalam peran `README.md` WANITA atau komentar kode, dan hanya dikunjungi di ulasan PR."

